flowchart TB
  subgraph Browser
    SPA["Vue 3 SPA<br/>Pinia · Vuetify · Hebrew RTL<br/>access token in memory only"]
  end

  subgraph Cloudflare
    PAGES["Pages<br/>static SPA + edge middleware"]
    PROXY["Worker<br/>api.* / ws.* proxy"]
  end

  subgraph AWS["AWS · eu-west-1"]
    HTTP["HTTP API<br/>Cognito JWT authorizer"]
    WSAPI["WebSocket API"]
    API["105 HTTP Lambdas<br/>one per action<br/>RolesGuard · DTO validation"]
    TRIG["5 Cognito trigger Lambdas<br/>email OTP · post-confirmation"]
    COG[("Cognito<br/>groups = roles")]
    DDB[("DynamoDB<br/>19 tables + GSIs")]
    REDIS[("Redis<br/>versioned read cache")]
    S3[("S3<br/>receipts · documents · PDFs")]
    PIPE["9 EventBridge Pipes"]
    BUS["Project event bus"]
    OBS["18 observer Lambdas<br/>cascade delete · cross-entity sync"]
    BC["Broadcaster Lambda<br/>room-scoped fan-out"]
    SOCK["connect · disconnect · rooms<br/>JWT verified on $connect"]
  end

  SPA -->|static assets| PAGES
  SPA -->|"REST · Bearer token"| PROXY
  SPA <-->|"WSS · token in subprotocol"| PROXY
  PROXY --> HTTP
  PROXY <--> WSAPI
  HTTP --> API
  API --> COG
  COG --> TRIG
  API --> DDB
  API <--> REDIS
  API --> S3
  DDB -->|Streams| PIPE --> BUS --> OBS --> DDB
  DDB -->|Streams| BC
  BC -->|"notify {action, id}"| WSAPI
  WSAPI --> SOCK

  classDef store fill:#fff7ed,stroke:#c2410c,color:#431407
  classDef fn fill:#ecfdf5,stroke:#047857,color:#022c22
  classDef edge fill:#eff6ff,stroke:#1d4ed8,color:#172554
  class COG,DDB,REDIS,S3 store
  class API,TRIG,OBS,BC,SOCK fn
